{
"file": 250,
"paths": [
"d007/d011/f203"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "70c1445a",
"en_raw": "Hey Murase, listen!"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "88148421",
"en_raw": "In this world"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "3c152381",
"en_raw": "there are really bad people, or rather"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "c62964a6",
"en_raw": "perverts who are out of their minds"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "418f19b7",
"en_raw": "There are people like that"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "13fa6546",
"en_raw": "Did something happen?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "f20ce5f6",
"en_raw": "...Geez"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "74ce9db5",
"en_raw": "I can't forgive this!"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "2d6fc450",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sanjo"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "a7608b64",
"en_raw": "About what we just talked about..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "bd12dfa2",
"en_raw": "I thought you weren't interested?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "85045a8a",
"en_raw": "Well, fine"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "1f0d59f0",
"en_raw": "Hey, Sanjo..."
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "6f2b4857",
"en_raw": "If you catch the culprit"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "833d942f",
"en_raw": "definitely bring them to me"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "4b1adabe",
"en_raw": "(...I can't say it after all)"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b1741ad1",
"en_raw": "We"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "0590e52e",
"en_raw": "practice at the Tama River grounds"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "64a76103",
"en_raw": "on Saturdays"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "4803d9f4",
"en_raw": "The other day, running along the embankment"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "b315e7a0",
"en_raw": "I heard something like a cat meowing"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "2d759477",
"en_raw": "and from the riverbank, at that"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "3dd201b9",
"en_raw": "I thought it was strange"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "101cf69b",
"en_raw": "so my senior and I went to look..."
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "3585aee5",
"en_raw": "...Seriously, why"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "8604dcd8",
"en_raw": "would anyone do that!"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "3654fd5d",
"en_raw": "Well... hey, calm down"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "6133ac82",
"en_raw": "Kittens! Kittens! Get it?"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "fd0e92e6",
"en_raw": "...Poor things"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "f3ce3082",
"en_raw": "Skinny as bones"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "bc53edb0",
"en_raw": "Why do you think?"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "03c5193d",
"en_raw": "In a jar! In a jar!"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "03d66d05",
"en_raw": "...A jar like the ones for making plum wine"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "92c11d05",
"en_raw": "with token holes poked in it"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "fd00a9de",
"en_raw": "It could only have been done"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "6ad3df3a",
"en_raw": "to starve them alive!"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "b270d03a",
"en_raw": "I wish I hadn't asked..."
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "c3100fc9",
"en_raw": "Why are you being so weak!"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "a98a9a3d",
"en_raw": "If it were me"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "3f46d4eb",
"en_raw": "I'd catch whoever did it"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "d619de61",
"en_raw": "and do the same to them!"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "76b67ede",
"en_raw": "No way..."
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "fcc95e05",
"en_raw": "But it's creepy, that"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "5bd0e8b3",
"en_raw": "like some kind of sacrifice..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "7515fa9c",
"en_raw": "...Sacrifice? ...Ah!"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "70898ab5",
"en_raw": "...Murase?"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "2bc66e16",
"en_raw": "...I-I didn't do it"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "82e249a5",
"en_raw": "Nobody said it was you"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "450256e8",
"en_raw": "Murase!"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "4ca01bc4",
"en_raw": "I only asked if you"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "5fc8a859",
"en_raw": "knew anything"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "924be5c6",
"en_raw": "I-I honestly"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "b8a6e2c1",
"en_raw": "can't think of anything..."
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "aa6d18ff",
"en_raw": "When I take the embankment on walks"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "11113053",
"en_raw": "I'll try to be careful"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "9b78dfeb",
"en_raw": "Obtained the rumor of the Cat Sacrifice..."
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "731d2de3",
"en_raw": "If I were killed like that"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "52376de6",
"en_raw": "I'd put a huge curse on them"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "16080309",
"en_raw": "as a cat"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "a90e4df3",
"en_raw": "Murase, surely not..."
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "663f6bd8",
"en_raw": "Just kidding"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "1ef410ef",
"en_raw": "Murase of all people"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "fb628a53",
"en_raw": "would never be involved"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "274e771b",
"en_raw": "in something like that"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "e1ea508c",
"en_raw": "Sorry, I have something to do..."
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "082564a1",
"en_raw": "If you learn anything"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "e46806bd",
"en_raw": "definitely tell me!"
}
]
}